  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 510.01 Pro-rating Registration Fee",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 510.01 Pro-rating Registration Fee.\n\n(a) Except as provided hereafter, the month in which an application for registration is processed by the department shall serve as the starting month for pro-rating registration fees.\n\n(b) If an applicant is issued a 5 month municipal permit and applies for registration within the first 7 days of the next month, the month in which the municipal permit is issued shall serve as the starting month for pro-rating registration fees.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #8999, eff 9-29-07; ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 511.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
